Package: dotlet
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Dotlet maintainers <maintainers@localhost>
Depends: bind9, bind9-utils, dnsutils, iproute2, python3 (>= 3.10), python3-minimal, adduser, sudo, systemd
Suggests: apparmor, ufw
Conflicts: dotlet-dns
Description: lightweight IPv4 and IPv6 DNS server with a small web UI
 Dotlet manages BIND9 zones and common DNS records through a compact,
 dependency-free web interface. It validates every generated configuration,
 applies changes atomically, and rolls back failed reloads.
